   {
    "html": "<div class=\"vc-in\" style=\"--g:4fr 8fr\"><div class=\"vc-in-c\"><ul><li><a href=\"/images/wp/2022/10/slider_MedicsIntegralSalut5.webp\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"900\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/wp/2022/10/slider_MedicsIntegralSalut5.webp\" width=\"600\"/></a></li><li><a href=\"/images/wp/2022/10/slider_MedicsIntegralSalut4.webp\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"900\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/wp/2022/10/slider_MedicsIntegralSalut4.webp\" width=\"600\"/></a></li><li><a href=\"/images/wp/2022/10/slider_MedicsIntegralSalut3.webp\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"900\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/wp/2022/10/slider_MedicsIntegralSalut3.webp\" width=\"600\"/></a></li><li><a href=\"/images/wp/2022/10/slider_MedicsIntegralSalut2.webp\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"900\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/wp/2022/10/slider_MedicsIntegralSalut2.webp\" width=\"600\"/></a></li><li><a href=\"/images/wp/2022/10/slider_MedicsIntegralSalut1.webp\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"900\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/wp/2022/10/slider_MedicsIntegralSalut1.webp\" width=\"600\"/></a></li><li><a href=\"/images/wp/2022/10/slider_MedicsIntegralSalut0.webp\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"900\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/wp/2022/10/slider_MedicsIntegralSalut0.webp\" width=\"600\"/></a></li><li><a href=\"/images/wp/2022/10/slider_MedicsIntegralSalut6.webp\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"900\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/wp/2022/10/slider_MedicsIntegralSalut6.webp\" width=\"600\"/></a></li></ul></div><div class=\"vc-in-c\"><p>Medics Integral Salut isn't just another clinic; our priority is for our patients to find what they're looking for: RESULTS. We have been in Girona since 2014, our clinic<a href=\"/en/\"> Aesthetic medicine in Girona</a> is closely related to Clínica Rinos in Barcelona, a clinic with over 25 years of experience and a large medical team, the same one we have in Girona.</p><p>Medics Integral Salut has different Units. In each of them, we have strived for excellence from the medical-surgical team: the best, the most prepared, the most and best trained to be able to offer our patients the solution they expect.</p><p>Our patients undergo surgery in different hospitals in Girona or Barcelona. Depending on the type of surgery, we select the hospital that can offer the best coverage. Not all surgeries are the same, and not all hospitals specialise in the different procedures we perform.</p></div></div>\n<img class=\"vc-ico\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"40\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/wp/2019/10/ntick.webp\" width=\"40\"/>\n<h5>With a medical team with over 25 years dedicated to surgery</h5>\n<img class=\"vc-ico\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"40\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/wp/2019/10/ntick.webp\" width=\"40\"/>\n<h5>Plastic Surgeons members of SECPRE</h5>\n<img class=\"vc-ico\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"40\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/wp/2019/10/ntick.webp\" width=\"40\"/>\n<h5>Authorised by the Department of Health of the Generalitat</h5>\n<img class=\"vc-ico\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"40\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/wp/2019/10/ntick.webp\" width=\"40\"/>\n<h5>All interventions in authorised surgical centres</h5>\n<img class=\"vc-ico\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"40\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/wp/2019/10/ntick.webp\" width=\"40\"/>\n<h5>Clinic in the centre of Girona</h5>"
   }
  ]
 },
